{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50348","headline":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 一、三危山咏 · 敦煌人作品[一]","name":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 一、三危山咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三危[七]镇羣望，岫崿凌穹苍。\n万古不毛髪，四时含雪霜。\n岩连九陇险，地窜三苗乡。\n风雨暗溪谷，令人心自伤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"敦煌人作品[一]","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50348.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50348","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}